WEBVTT

00:00:10.052 --> 00:00:13.013
"Omiya Station"

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.057
"FRUIT TART FOR LIFE"

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:15.516
"FRUIT TART FOR LIFE"
My name is Tone Honmachi.

00:00:15.516 --> 00:00:17.476
My name is Tone Honmachi.

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:18.977
I'm a first-year in high school.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:19.520
"FRUIT TART CONCERT
CD RELEASE EVENT IN OMIYA"
I'm a first-year in high school.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.897
"FRUIT TART CONCERT
CD RELEASE EVENT IN OMIYA"
It's been three years since I moved
to Tokyo from the Kansai region.

00:00:21.897 --> 00:00:24.775
"FRUIT TART CONCERT
CD RELEASE EVENT IN OMIYA"
I love singing so I've always been in choir.

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:27.069
My hard efforts and vocal training

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:27.861
"FRUIT TART FOR LIFE"
My hard efforts and vocal training

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:30.155
"FRUIT TART FOR LIFE"
finally pay off today!

00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:34.952
Welcome!

00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:38.121
Why not pick up a copy of Fruit Tart's new CD?!

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:40.457
As long as you're satisfied with that...

00:02:21.183 --> 00:02:22.768
"Diuretic Effect!"

00:02:22.768 --> 00:02:24.686
"Diuretic Effect!"
Diuretic Effect!

00:02:24.686 --> 00:02:26.438
"Diuretic Effect!"

00:02:26.605 --> 00:02:29.566
"The day before the concert"

00:02:29.566 --> 00:02:30.817
"FRUIT TART
'A TART FEELING'"

00:02:36.073 --> 00:02:38.033
S-So this is...

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:39.785
...our...

00:02:41.119 --> 00:02:41.411
"FRUIT TART
'A TART FEELING'"

00:02:41.411 --> 00:02:43.539
"FRUIT TART
'A TART FEELING'"
...debut single...?!

00:02:43.539 --> 00:02:45.415
"FRUIT TART
'A TART FEELING'"

00:02:45.624 --> 00:02:47.501
I'm betting everything

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:49.336
on your future, girls!

00:02:51.046 --> 00:02:52.339
Um...

00:02:52.339 --> 00:02:54.091
How many copies did we produce?

00:02:54.091 --> 00:02:55.717
Three thousand!

00:02:55.717 --> 00:02:58.387
Oh, we're already dead, for sure.

00:02:58.387 --> 00:03:00.430
Three thousand copies, huh?

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:04.142
Isn't that a bit much for an independent label?

00:03:04.142 --> 00:03:08.021
I don't even think we have that many fans...

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:10.274
Oh, not to worry at all!

00:03:10.274 --> 00:03:13.318
Believe it or not, our program
has pretty good ratings.

00:03:13.318 --> 00:03:15.904
What?! Really?

00:03:15.904 --> 00:03:19.658
Especially since <i>Anmitsu Academy</i>
airs right before us now.

00:03:19.658 --> 00:03:20.409
"12:00 AM" "New Program! <i>Anmitsu Academy</i>"
"12:55 AM" "Dropout Idol Fruit Tart"
Especially since <i>Anmitsu Academy</i>
airs right before us now.

00:03:20.409 --> 00:03:21.618
"12:00 AM" "New Program! <i>Anmitsu Academy</i>"
"12:55 AM" "Dropout Idol Fruit Tart"
As long as the viewers leave
the channel on, our ratings will soar.

00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:23.579
"1:00 AM" "Sotomura Winters"
"Sotomura scolds a rebellious girl."
As long as the viewers leave
the channel on, our ratings will soar.

00:03:23.579 --> 00:03:24.413
As long as the viewers leave
the channel on, our ratings will soar.

00:03:24.413 --> 00:03:26.206
The program after us is popular, too.

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:29.418
So we'll become popular in no time!

00:03:30.335 --> 00:03:32.921
Not only will we be able to pay back our debt,

00:03:32.921 --> 00:03:37.009
I'll be promoted as a talented producer
at an unprecedented pace.

00:03:38.468 --> 00:03:40.762
That means sushi at Ginza, every day!

00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:44.183
--I'll be out partying all night,
taking taxis, woohoo!
--Yup, we're done for, for sure.

00:03:45.851 --> 00:03:46.185
"FRUIT TART"
"Omiya Concert!" "Free Admission"

00:03:46.185 --> 00:03:50.522
"FRUIT TART"
"Omiya Concert!" "Free Admission"
Why exactly are we having our debut single
release event in Saitama, of all places?

00:03:50.522 --> 00:03:52.816
Aren't events like that usually
held in Tokyo or Yokohama,

00:03:52.816 --> 00:03:55.861
or at least where we're based in Higako?

00:03:55.861 --> 00:03:59.156
Roko, Higashi-Koganei is Tokyo, too, you know?

00:03:59.156 --> 00:04:01.742
I'd rather perform in Shinjuku or Shibuya!

00:04:01.742 --> 00:04:04.494
I hope we'll have an audience...

00:04:04.494 --> 00:04:07.873
As long as I'm with Ino-<i>sempai</i>,
I don't care where we perform.

00:04:07.873 --> 00:04:08.916
Give me a break.

00:04:08.916 --> 00:04:12.961
Popular places like Tokyo or Yokohama
are always booked up

00:04:12.961 --> 00:04:14.379
and expensive...

00:04:14.379 --> 00:04:16.840
And Higako's just, you know...

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:18.675
...pretty deserted.

00:04:18.675 --> 00:04:20.802
That's not nice!

00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:22.596
And plus, Omiya...

00:04:22.596 --> 00:04:24.389
...is my hometown...

00:04:24.389 --> 00:04:26.850
So I thought it suited the occasion...

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:28.977
For your own convenience?!

00:04:28.977 --> 00:04:31.772
It's better to be in populated Saitama
than in deserted Tokyo!

00:04:31.772 --> 00:04:33.732
Yokohama's in Kanagawa, too, you know?

00:04:33.732 --> 00:04:36.026
Population-wise, Saitama...

00:04:36.026 --> 00:04:37.945
...probably has a bigger one!

00:04:39.112 --> 00:04:42.574
"FRUIT TART
'A TART FEELING'"
Let's not forget about the 3,000 copies!

00:04:42.574 --> 00:04:44.243
"10:00 AM" "Free Concert (Morning half)"
"10:40 AM" "Merch Sales"
The concert's going to be free!

00:04:44.243 --> 00:04:46.328
"10:00 AM" "Free Concert (Morning half)"
"10:40 AM" "Merch Sales"
We'll sell merch after the morning show!

00:04:46.328 --> 00:04:46.870
"10:00 AM" "Free Concert (Morning half)"
"10:40 AM" "Merch Sales"
We'll sell more merch after the afternoon show!

00:04:46.870 --> 00:04:48.330
"1:30 PM" "Free Concert (Afternoon half)"
"2:10 PM" "Merch Sales"
We'll sell more merch after the afternoon show!

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:52.334
"1:30 PM" "Free Concert (Afternoon half)"
"2:10 PM" "Merch Sales"
If anything, tomorrow's more
about selling merch!

00:04:52.334 --> 00:04:55.587
Um... I'd like to ask, just in case.

00:04:55.587 --> 00:04:57.923
What happens if it doesn't sell?

00:04:59.967 --> 00:05:01.218
Well...

00:05:01.218 --> 00:05:04.263
Just know that sales and swimsuit
surface area are correlated.

00:05:04.263 --> 00:05:05.597
Surface area?

00:05:05.597 --> 00:05:07.099
Does that mean...?

00:05:10.018 --> 00:05:12.229
Oh no!

00:05:12.229 --> 00:05:14.147
How does that work?!

00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:15.482
What do you expect me to do?!

00:05:15.482 --> 00:05:17.568
I've already put a million yen into this!

00:05:17.568 --> 00:05:18.819
That's your doing!

00:05:18.819 --> 00:05:22.322
Look at all these receipts!

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:23.949
Producing CDs and arranging concerts...

00:05:23.949 --> 00:05:27.119
All these expenses add up, you know?!

00:05:27.119 --> 00:05:29.454
Transportation and consumables...

00:05:29.454 --> 00:05:32.583
It sure does seem like lots of expenses...

00:05:35.669 --> 00:05:37.129
What is this?!

00:05:37.129 --> 00:05:40.841
A meal expense at an
<i>unagi </i>place for 10,000 yen?!

00:05:40.841 --> 00:05:43.135
You all wouldn't understand yet...

00:05:43.135 --> 00:05:45.971
There's a lot involved
when it comes to business.

00:05:45.971 --> 00:05:50.392
Plus, there's no way I could take
the higher-ups out for beef bowl!

00:05:50.392 --> 00:05:51.310
Even though it's good.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:53.061
Really good!

00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:54.313
In any case!

00:05:54.313 --> 00:05:58.192
None of this would matter as long as
we sell the CDs tomorrow!

00:05:58.192 --> 00:06:01.612
I'll treat you girls to a feast, too, of course!

00:06:05.616 --> 00:06:07.659
To a super large-size beef bowl!

00:06:07.659 --> 00:06:10.329
We want the eel bowl!

00:06:10.329 --> 00:06:12.456
So since we're a bit desperate here,

00:06:12.456 --> 00:06:14.958
I arranged for a helper to sell merch tomorrow.

00:06:14.958 --> 00:06:16.877
She changed the subject.

00:06:16.877 --> 00:06:19.004
So who's the helper?

00:06:19.004 --> 00:06:20.422
Hey there!

00:06:20.422 --> 00:06:23.008
Tone, the assistant at your service!

00:06:23.008 --> 00:06:25.886
Based on my experience
going to various idol events,

00:06:25.886 --> 00:06:28.847
I'm here to teach you girls
the know-how of merch selling!

00:06:28.847 --> 00:06:30.474
--Tone?!
--Tonecchi?!

00:06:30.474 --> 00:06:31.892
A-Are you sure?

00:06:31.892 --> 00:06:34.394
Does she have a hold on you or something?

00:06:34.394 --> 00:06:35.646
Hey!

00:06:35.646 --> 00:06:36.939
Not at all.

00:06:36.939 --> 00:06:38.607
My family runs a restaurant

00:06:38.607 --> 00:06:40.359
and I'm good at customer service.

00:06:40.359 --> 00:06:42.027
I'm getting paid, too.

00:06:42.027 --> 00:06:45.822
But best of all, I'm just really happy
to get to help you girls out.

00:06:45.822 --> 00:06:46.949
Tone...

00:06:46.949 --> 00:06:49.326
You've got so much love for us...

00:06:49.326 --> 00:06:51.578
As expected of my rival...

00:06:51.578 --> 00:06:56.124
And plus, Tone's really popular
with the viewers, too.

00:06:56.124 --> 00:06:59.253
Everyone's talking about the
"busty regular high-school girl."

00:06:59.253 --> 00:07:01.505
You really are the worst, Hoho!

00:07:01.713 --> 00:07:03.340
"COFFEEYA"

00:07:03.966 --> 00:07:06.134
Well, let's get right into it.

00:07:06.134 --> 00:07:08.762
I'll teach you the secrets
of selling as an idol!

00:07:08.762 --> 00:07:09.930
Yes!

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.808
First, bowing politely is crucial!

00:07:12.808 --> 00:07:14.518
Bow at 45 degrees.

00:07:14.518 --> 00:07:15.853
Keep your hands in front of you

00:07:15.853 --> 00:07:18.772
and be mindful of keeping a beautiful posture.

00:07:24.945 --> 00:07:27.656
That's it. You're all doing great, girls.

00:07:27.656 --> 00:07:30.367
Never forget to keep your
fingertips together in the front.

00:07:30.367 --> 00:07:32.411
She's got this down!

00:07:32.411 --> 00:07:36.039
She's a natural at playing this game.

00:07:36.039 --> 00:07:38.000
A force to be reckoned with!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.627
Next I'll teach you how to handle
the merch and do a handshake.

00:07:40.627 --> 00:07:41.503
Yes!

00:07:41.503 --> 00:07:43.630
Miss Sakura, give it a try.

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:45.007
Y-Yes!

00:07:46.925 --> 00:07:49.845
Thank you very much for your purchase!

00:07:49.845 --> 00:07:51.847
S-Sure...

00:07:54.433 --> 00:07:55.809
That's no good!

00:07:55.809 --> 00:07:57.477
The handing over of the merch
should be treated as

00:07:57.477 --> 00:08:00.272
a miraculous moment shared
between an idol and a fan.

00:08:00.272 --> 00:08:02.983
Express your gratitude to the fullest!

00:08:02.983 --> 00:08:04.735
Y-Yes!

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:10.115
Thank you very much for your support!

00:08:21.418 --> 00:08:27.341
Um... If I bought all the CDs, does that mean
I get to shake everyone's hand forever?

00:08:28.759 --> 00:08:31.887
Only a creep would think of something like that!

00:08:31.887 --> 00:08:34.681
Then! You'll send them off
with a message and a smile!

00:08:34.681 --> 00:08:36.808
I sang my heart out for you!

00:08:36.808 --> 00:08:40.354
It's effective if you keep it short and cute.

00:08:40.354 --> 00:08:42.481
Don't bother listening to it that much.

00:08:42.481 --> 00:08:44.942
Establish that character and appeal of yours!

00:08:44.942 --> 00:08:48.028
It's embarrassing,
but please keep supporting us.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:55.118
May I take all of Ino-<i>sempai</i>'s
handshake tickets?

00:09:00.582 --> 00:09:04.503
A-And you know what?
Using small props would work, too.

00:09:05.671 --> 00:09:08.382
For me, it'd be the <i>okonomiyaki </i>spatula.

00:09:08.382 --> 00:09:11.844
Your fans will remember you better
if you have a strong character.

00:09:11.844 --> 00:09:13.220
I see...

00:09:14.471 --> 00:09:16.515
"Backpack!!"
"8th year in elementary school"

00:09:16.515 --> 00:09:18.767
"Backpack!!"
"8th year in elementary school"
It's true, even after the hype passed,

00:09:18.767 --> 00:09:21.687
"Backpack!!"
"8th year in elementary school"
I'd sell more if I wore a backpack.

00:09:21.687 --> 00:09:23.814
Oh, Roko!

00:09:23.814 --> 00:09:24.314
"Shubihan-i Hiroshi"

00:09:24.314 --> 00:09:26.358
"Shubihan-i Hiroshi"
You girls improved a lot!

00:09:26.358 --> 00:09:29.152
Now you're all totally prepared for tomorrow!

00:09:29.152 --> 00:09:30.445
Totally prepared?

00:09:30.445 --> 00:09:32.739
How about a run-down of the concert?

00:09:32.739 --> 00:09:35.367
We're singing the B-side of
the single tomorrow, too, right?

00:09:35.367 --> 00:09:36.702
Don't we need to rehearse?

00:09:36.702 --> 00:09:37.828
What...?

00:09:40.122 --> 00:09:42.249
But it's too late now and a hassle--

00:09:42.249 --> 00:09:44.209
What?! A B-side?!

00:09:44.209 --> 00:09:46.920
There's another new song?!

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:49.006
Yeah, it was finished the other day.

00:09:49.006 --> 00:09:50.674
What kind of song is it...?

00:09:50.674 --> 00:09:51.383
"1. A Tart Feeling"
"2. Aim for it! No. 1 Curry!"
What kind of song is it...?

00:09:51.383 --> 00:09:53.260
"1. A Tart Feeling"
"2. Aim for it! No. 1 Curry!"
A song about curry...?

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:54.761
"1. A Tart Feeling"
"2. Aim for it! No. 1 Curry!"
But why?

00:09:54.761 --> 00:09:57.556
I'm Riri Higashi, a producer at Cat Productions.

00:09:57.556 --> 00:10:01.810
I'm 25 years old, my birthday is
December 12th, and I'm blood type A.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:04.271
My favorite thing is Hoho!

00:10:11.528 --> 00:10:13.530
<i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:10:16.074 --> 00:10:18.076
"Today's the concert!"

00:10:25.918 --> 00:10:27.419
What's that? Cosplay?

00:10:27.419 --> 00:10:28.545
Is there a festival?

00:10:28.545 --> 00:10:30.547
Hey, doesn't that girl look like Broko?

00:10:30.547 --> 00:10:32.841
--Remember that popular
child actor back in the day?
--Darn you, Hoho...

00:10:32.841 --> 00:10:34.259
Sorry, sorry!

00:10:34.259 --> 00:10:36.011
The car's loaded with CDs

00:10:36.011 --> 00:10:39.348
and I'm picking up Tone,
so you girls have to take the train.

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:43.894
I want to get off as soon as possible.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:46.063
There, there.

00:10:46.063 --> 00:10:48.315
"Omiya Station"

00:10:50.776 --> 00:10:52.903
Amazing... There's the stage!

00:10:52.903 --> 00:10:54.905
Way to go, Saitama.

00:10:55.822 --> 00:10:57.449
Everyone, look!

00:10:57.449 --> 00:10:59.326
There's a big crowd!

00:10:59.326 --> 00:11:00.994
N-No way!

00:11:00.994 --> 00:11:04.414
I never expected us to have so many fans!

00:11:04.414 --> 00:11:06.917
There's still an hour before showtime, too!

00:11:06.917 --> 00:11:09.086
It's like we're Cream Anmitsu, or something.

00:11:09.086 --> 00:11:11.672
The capacity of the venue
is pretty much the same.

00:11:11.672 --> 00:11:13.465
At this rate,

00:11:13.465 --> 00:11:16.635
we'll surpass Chiko and them in no time.

00:11:16.635 --> 00:11:18.929
Her darkness is coming out?!

00:11:18.929 --> 00:11:19.596
"Omiya Hall
Orchestra Stage"
Her darkness is coming out?!

00:11:19.596 --> 00:11:20.889
"Omiya Hall
Orchestra Stage"
But wait a minute.

00:11:20.889 --> 00:11:24.184
"Omiya Hall
Orchestra Stage"
It looks like they're the audience
for the orchestra concert next door.

00:11:24.184 --> 00:11:25.060
"Omiya Hall
Orchestra Stage"
What?!

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.895
Then, all those people...

00:11:26.895 --> 00:11:29.147
...aren't here for our concert...

00:11:29.147 --> 00:11:30.315
How sad!

00:11:30.315 --> 00:11:33.819
But yeah, our crowd wouldn't
be wearing formal clothes.

00:11:33.819 --> 00:11:35.279
Darn it, Chiko.

00:11:35.279 --> 00:11:37.322
Don't think you beat us yet.

00:11:37.322 --> 00:11:39.408
I'll surpass you someday...

00:11:39.408 --> 00:11:41.451
With height and breasts!

00:11:41.451 --> 00:11:44.204
A deeper darkness than we thought...?

00:11:44.204 --> 00:11:45.789
Hey, everyone!

00:11:45.789 --> 00:11:47.165
Over here, over here!

00:11:47.165 --> 00:11:49.376
The merch sale's started already!

00:11:49.376 --> 00:11:51.211
Look! It's Fruit Tart!

00:11:51.211 --> 00:11:53.839
Roko's so cute!

00:11:53.839 --> 00:11:54.965
See?

00:11:54.965 --> 00:11:57.259
You've got lots of fans here!

00:11:57.259 --> 00:11:58.177
That's right!

00:11:58.177 --> 00:12:00.762
Don't waste your time pouting.

00:12:00.762 --> 00:12:02.806
I-I'm not pouting!

00:12:02.806 --> 00:12:05.726
Being adored doesn't make me happy...

00:12:07.769 --> 00:12:10.814
The darkness wasn't deep at all!

00:12:10.814 --> 00:12:12.399
You're doing great, Tonecchi!

00:12:12.399 --> 00:12:14.776
So how's it going? Did we sell 1,000 yet?

00:12:14.776 --> 00:12:17.529
Oh, we're still not there yet.

00:12:17.529 --> 00:12:19.531
But it's going well.

00:12:19.531 --> 00:12:21.366
The merch seems to move well!

00:12:21.366 --> 00:12:23.327
Huh? What are we selling?

00:12:23.327 --> 00:12:23.577
"Fruit Tart"
Huh? What are we selling?

00:12:23.577 --> 00:12:26.455
"Fruit Tart"
We've got trading cards, pins,
towels, and glow sticks!

00:12:26.455 --> 00:12:27.998
"Fruit Tart"
There's so much to choose from!

00:12:27.998 --> 00:12:29.708
"Fruit Tart"
When did this happen?

00:12:29.708 --> 00:12:31.585
Hey, but these pictures...

00:12:31.585 --> 00:12:34.087
They were all taken secretly!

00:12:34.087 --> 00:12:36.340
See? Aren't they cute?

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:39.301
But here's my top pick!

00:12:39.301 --> 00:12:40.469
Check it out!

00:12:40.469 --> 00:12:42.471
The hug pillows with
everyone's pictures on them!

00:12:42.471 --> 00:12:45.891
You can take this Hayu home for only 9,800 yen!

00:12:45.891 --> 00:12:48.602
N-No! Stop it!

00:12:48.602 --> 00:12:51.939
I-I'd like to reserve three
of Ino-<i>sempai</i>'s hug pillows!

00:12:51.939 --> 00:12:54.858
I-I'd like to reserve one of each, please!

00:12:54.858 --> 00:12:57.110
All right! You got it!

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:58.612
Darn it, Hoho...

00:12:58.612 --> 00:13:00.781
She won't get away with this.

00:13:00.781 --> 00:13:02.991
Oh, there you girls are.

00:13:02.991 --> 00:13:04.451
Hoho...

00:13:05.369 --> 00:13:06.662
We kinda...

00:13:06.662 --> 00:13:09.289
No, we really need to talk.

00:13:09.289 --> 00:13:12.584
Oh, the merch? You finally saw them, didn't you?

00:13:12.584 --> 00:13:16.713
But don't you think they came out
rather innocently cute?

00:13:16.713 --> 00:13:17.881
Well...

00:13:17.881 --> 00:13:19.341
Have more confidence in yourself.

00:13:19.341 --> 00:13:20.217
See?

00:13:20.217 --> 00:13:23.887
--Welcome! Come take a look!
--You girls really are pretty popular, you know?

00:13:23.887 --> 00:13:25.180
Wh-Whatever.

00:13:25.180 --> 00:13:29.017
You can't fool me like that.

00:13:29.017 --> 00:13:31.228
Hayu's pretty easy, too.

00:13:31.228 --> 00:13:33.856
All right, there's not much time until showtime!

00:13:33.856 --> 00:13:35.315
Let's hurry and change!

00:13:35.315 --> 00:13:37.150
What? Change?

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:39.570
Aren't we singing in these costumes?

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:40.863
Of course not!

00:13:40.863 --> 00:13:43.574
You can't perform in
a conservative outfit like that.

00:13:43.574 --> 00:13:45.993
Then why did you make us
wear these on the train?

00:13:45.993 --> 00:13:48.829
That's just part of a publicity stunt.

00:13:48.829 --> 00:13:50.956
I thought a little shame play

00:13:50.956 --> 00:13:54.418
would create a buzz on social media.

00:13:54.418 --> 00:13:56.378
What do you mean by shame play...?

00:13:59.131 --> 00:14:00.757
"Getting changed"

00:14:00.757 --> 00:14:02.593
"Getting changed"
We're all set!

00:14:06.847 --> 00:14:08.682
Wow, look at you all.

00:14:08.682 --> 00:14:10.350
You seem proud.

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:12.853
When you treated these costumes really badly.

00:14:12.853 --> 00:14:16.398
Honestly, I didn't know what to do
when I saw them at first...

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.444
It's because you're stingy
with the dry cleaning.

00:14:20.444 --> 00:14:21.737
Give me a break!

00:14:21.737 --> 00:14:24.531
Setting up this concert was really expensive!

00:14:24.531 --> 00:14:27.576
But you saved us, Nina-<i>sempai</i>!

00:14:27.576 --> 00:14:30.996
The holes are all non-existent
with the applique!

00:14:30.996 --> 00:14:32.915
I like this version a lot better!

00:14:32.915 --> 00:14:34.374
I agree.

00:14:34.374 --> 00:14:37.836
It's a lot showier and
more suited for the stage.

00:14:37.836 --> 00:14:39.922
You're a genius, Nina-<i>sempai</i>!

00:14:39.922 --> 00:14:41.215
Oh, stop.

00:14:41.215 --> 00:14:44.593
I just like cute clothes.

00:14:44.593 --> 00:14:47.513
But it still flatters me that you say that.

00:14:47.513 --> 00:14:49.306
Thanks, everyone!

00:14:50.599 --> 00:14:53.560
Tragedy strikes right before the concert,

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:58.106
but Fruit Tart overcomes it
with their cleverness and teamwork.

00:14:58.106 --> 00:14:59.566
Perfect!

00:14:59.566 --> 00:15:03.070
This is what I call
a classic idol success story!

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:05.614
You seriously deserve a good scolding.

00:15:05.614 --> 00:15:07.407
I'd like to have a word, too.

00:15:07.407 --> 00:15:10.994
I can't let anyone get away with
letting clothes go to waste.

00:15:10.994 --> 00:15:15.499
Come to think of it, it's Hemo's
first time wearing this costume!

00:15:19.336 --> 00:15:21.755
Huh?! Wh-What's the matter?

00:15:21.755 --> 00:15:23.382
I-I'm sorry.

00:15:23.382 --> 00:15:25.509
I'm just a bit nervous.

00:15:25.509 --> 00:15:27.845
Nervous...?!

00:15:27.845 --> 00:15:30.138
Do you need to go?! Is that it?!

00:15:32.516 --> 00:15:34.768
Or did you... already...?!

00:15:36.019 --> 00:15:38.730
You're the only one who'll wet yourself, Ino.

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:40.023
What?

00:15:40.023 --> 00:15:41.483
Today is their debut CD release!

00:15:41.483 --> 00:15:44.778
Come get your Fruit Tart merch here!

00:15:44.778 --> 00:15:47.990
The morning concert will be starting soon!

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:49.783
"FRUIT TART"
"Omiya Concert!" "Free Admission"
It's a free concert!

00:15:49.783 --> 00:15:50.450
"FRUIT TART"
"Omiya Concert!" "Free Admission"
Fruit Tart makes their CD debut today!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.286
Fruit Tart makes their CD debut today!

00:15:52.286 --> 00:15:54.663
Thank you for all your support!

00:15:54.663 --> 00:15:56.164
Tone!

00:15:56.373 --> 00:15:57.207
"Fruit Tart" "Saké" "Okonomiyaki Tone"

00:15:57.207 --> 00:15:59.918
"Fruit Tart" "Saké" "Okonomiyaki Tone"
Mom! And our neighbors!

00:15:59.918 --> 00:16:02.087
"Fruit Tart" "Saké" "Okonomiyaki Tone"
We came out to support!

00:16:02.087 --> 00:16:05.340
"Fruit Tart" "Saké" "Okonomiyaki Tone"
Fruit Tart is the star of Higako!

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:07.134
"Fruit Tart" "Saké" "Okonomiyaki Tone"
We can't lose to Omiya.

00:16:07.134 --> 00:16:10.220
You can count on us local fans
to support you away from home!

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:11.430
That's right!

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:15.017
I'll make sure the star of Higako
becomes a national star!

00:16:15.017 --> 00:16:16.518
Yeah!

00:16:19.188 --> 00:16:23.483
Well, it is Hemo's first concert after all.

00:16:23.483 --> 00:16:24.484
Yes...

00:16:24.484 --> 00:16:28.280
I feel too embarrassed to
sing in front of an audience.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:30.073
I completely understand.

00:16:30.073 --> 00:16:33.619
I got really nervous in the beginning, too.

00:16:33.619 --> 00:16:37.581
Singing on stage is a special thing.

00:16:37.581 --> 00:16:38.832
I'm sorry.

00:16:38.832 --> 00:16:42.544
When I get nervous, I start to cry.

00:16:42.544 --> 00:16:44.463
What?! That's not fair!

00:16:44.463 --> 00:16:47.174
Crying is a lot cuter than my nervous reaction!

00:16:47.174 --> 00:16:51.303
Yeah. Yours isn't cute at all.

00:16:51.303 --> 00:16:53.263
Are you okay? Did you wet yourself?

00:16:53.263 --> 00:16:55.015
H-How rude!

00:16:55.015 --> 00:16:56.934
I've already changed once this morning!

00:16:56.934 --> 00:16:59.853
And I brought two extra pairs just in case!

00:16:59.853 --> 00:17:02.147
What...? You already did in the morning...?

00:17:02.147 --> 00:17:03.857
Two extra pairs...?

00:17:03.857 --> 00:17:05.776
So you assume that you're going to...

00:17:05.776 --> 00:17:08.695
Okay! Enough about me!

00:17:11.073 --> 00:17:12.449
Hemo...

00:17:12.449 --> 00:17:13.534
Yes.

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:17.871
You're not the only one who's nervous.

00:17:17.871 --> 00:17:19.122
Oh?

00:17:19.122 --> 00:17:21.792
We're all nervous, too.

00:17:21.792 --> 00:17:25.504
To be honest, I'm still scared, too.

00:17:25.504 --> 00:17:26.964
Will I dance well?

00:17:26.964 --> 00:17:28.966
Will I forget the lyrics?

00:17:28.966 --> 00:17:31.552
Will the audience like it?

00:17:31.552 --> 00:17:33.637
Those thoughts don't stop.

00:17:33.637 --> 00:17:34.847
But...

00:17:34.847 --> 00:17:37.057
We're not the only ones who deal with that.

00:17:37.057 --> 00:17:40.269
All the people supporting us

00:17:40.269 --> 00:17:43.313
are also nervous, too, in some ways.

00:17:44.439 --> 00:17:45.816
We're not alone.

00:17:45.816 --> 00:17:47.359
We're all in this together.

00:17:48.235 --> 00:17:49.319
So that's why

00:17:49.319 --> 00:17:52.865
I think this nervousness is a wonderful thing.

00:17:53.866 --> 00:17:56.201
Injecting courage!

00:17:57.286 --> 00:17:58.829
Do you remember?

00:17:58.829 --> 00:18:01.623
At Fruit Tart's first concert?

00:18:03.292 --> 00:18:06.670
I also dreamed of becoming an idol
ever since I was little!

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:11.300
I wanted to see if I would change
if I ever became an idol.

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:16.430
That's why I want you to do great
for your first concert, Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:20.809
Your supportive words that time
gave me the courage!

00:18:20.809 --> 00:18:24.688
This time, it's my turn
to give you that courage!

00:18:24.688 --> 00:18:27.065
It's going to be okay. We're all here together.

00:18:27.065 --> 00:18:28.817
It'll be okay.

00:18:28.817 --> 00:18:32.154
So please smile, Hemo!

00:18:32.154 --> 00:18:34.239
Ino-<i>sempai</i>...

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.037
Hey, Inocchi...

00:18:40.037 --> 00:18:42.664
I just wanted to let you know...

00:18:43.707 --> 00:18:45.417
...that we're out in public...

00:18:50.339 --> 00:18:53.675
All right, let's give it our all!

00:18:55.385 --> 00:18:57.137
"A Tart Feeling"!

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.235
She was right...

00:19:53.235 --> 00:19:55.070
This is amazing!

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:58.115
I'm able to sing with a smile!

00:19:58.115 --> 00:20:01.243
This is the power of Ino-<i>sempai</i>.

00:20:01.243 --> 00:20:03.453
Ino-<i>sempai</i>'s love!

00:20:03.453 --> 00:20:06.039
You're so wonderful, Ino-<i>sempai</i>!

00:20:06.039 --> 00:20:09.251
Ino-<i>sempai</i>... Ino-<i>sempai</i>...!

00:20:15.549 --> 00:20:17.926
Wh-What's this brilliance?

00:20:18.844 --> 00:20:21.597
This concert will be legendary.

00:20:21.597 --> 00:20:23.891
We're experiencing a miracle right now!

00:20:23.891 --> 00:20:27.811
We're witnessing a legendary moment!

00:20:36.111 --> 00:20:38.363
Do you see their aura?

00:20:38.363 --> 00:20:41.325
They're just starting out, right? Amazing...

00:20:43.118 --> 00:20:45.996
Thanks, everyone!

00:20:48.415 --> 00:20:52.127
We'll be performing the B-side track
in the afternoon show!

00:20:52.127 --> 00:20:55.047
Please come see us again, everyone!

00:20:56.548 --> 00:21:00.427
Precious... This is too precious...

00:21:00.427 --> 00:21:03.597
Well done, girls! You were all great!

00:21:03.597 --> 00:21:04.723
Really?!

00:21:04.723 --> 00:21:06.183
There was definitely some traction!

00:21:06.183 --> 00:21:07.017
Yeah!

00:21:07.017 --> 00:21:08.769
The audience was all into it!

00:21:08.769 --> 00:21:11.104
It's Ino-<i>sempai</i>'s magic.

00:21:11.104 --> 00:21:13.857
The panty flashing in the beginning
was especially great!

00:21:13.857 --> 00:21:16.068
I got it all on tape.

00:21:17.486 --> 00:21:18.695
You...

00:21:18.695 --> 00:21:20.906
You're getting a real scolding later.

00:21:20.906 --> 00:21:23.575
What? But why?

00:21:24.952 --> 00:21:27.996
That girl... She's really a gem.

00:21:27.996 --> 00:21:32.000
It was a bit of a waste to let her go...

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.504
In any case, I'm glad I came today.

00:21:36.713 --> 00:21:40.008
After the concert,
we better be rewarded with eel!

00:21:40.008 --> 00:21:43.053
Eel! Eel!

00:21:43.053 --> 00:21:46.014
Gosh. Okay, fine...

00:21:46.014 --> 00:21:48.183
Fruit Tart...

00:21:48.183 --> 00:21:50.269
What an interesting bunch.

00:23:25.781 --> 00:23:27.032
"Preview"

00:23:27.032 --> 00:23:30.619
"Preview"
