00:23:30.619 --> 00:23:32.204
Riri here!

00:23:32.204 --> 00:23:35.082
Fruit Tart's concert was
a big success, wasn't it?

00:23:35.082 --> 00:23:37.417
Props to the talented manager, Hoho!

00:23:37.417 --> 00:23:39.253
Next time, we get to see
the latter half of the concert.

00:23:39.253 --> 00:23:41.338
Oh? Who's that over there...?

00:23:41.338 --> 00:23:43.674
What are you doing here, President?

00:23:43.674 --> 00:23:45.676
"Dance and Shine!"
<i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:23:45.676 --> 00:23:48.345
"Dance and Shine!"
Episode 10: "Dance and Shine!"

00:23:48.345 --> 00:23:50.486
"Dance and Shine!"
See you next time!
